WEBVTT

asr-000001
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.240
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Gandang umaga po sa ating lahat. Good morning. Ay good afternoon. Good afternoon. It's been a very interesting day. We apologize for the lateness. I think, Sec, you're here at 3 p.m., no?

asr-000002
00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:25.820
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, it's already 1 hour 30 minutes late, no? But we'll try to be brief and concise. So, we'd like to thank everybody for coming today.

asr-000003
00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:39.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: The briefing of the Committee on Finance, Subcommittee B, on the proposed Fiscal Year 2027 National Expenditure Program of the DOST and its attached agencies are hereby called to order.

asr-000004
00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:53.500
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: We will be joined by some senators later. Ano po kami today? Multitasking. So, session is ongoing while we will be having our budget briefing.

asr-000005
00:00:53.500 --> 00:01:02.720
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And if some senators wish to drop by, they can drop by or they will send word ahead that they want to reserve some time for questions.

asr-000006
00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:10.580
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But if we finish and nobody says that they want to ask any questions, then we'll deem the budget submitted.

