asr-000075
00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:23.660
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Maraming salamat.

asr-000076
00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:26.820
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Magandang hapon pumuli sa ating lahat.

asr-000077
00:05:26.980 --> 00:05:31.240
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I'd like to thank the Secretary and all of the attached agency heads,

asr-000078
00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:34.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: mga regional directors at the leadership ng DOST.

asr-000079
00:05:34.660 --> 00:05:36.600
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Maraming maraming salamat po sa inyong pagpunta.

asr-000080
00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:43.060
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So let me begin my statement by quoting Secretary Solidum.

asr-000081
00:05:43.060 --> 00:05:47.300
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Sabi niya, dapat ramdam ang agham.

asr-000082
00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:50.080
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ang agham, dapat ramdam.

asr-000083
00:05:50.820 --> 00:05:58.360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And I think that is the best guide for everyone in the agency and for this budget process.

asr-000084
00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:03.300
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Na lahat po ng ginagawa po natin, dapat ramdam ng ating mga kababayan.

asr-000085
00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:10.160
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Whether immediately naramdaman or eventually maramdaman because we also do research.

asr-000086
00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:14.300
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Alam po natin na ang tamang paggamit ng aghama teknolohiya,

asr-000087
00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:17.300
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: sa tamang paggamit ng aghama teknolohiya,

asr-000088
00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:21.160
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: marami pong magagandang bagay ang pwedeng mangyari.

asr-000089
00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:24.960
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Pwede pong mapataas ang ani ng magsasaka at manging isda.

asr-000090
00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:27.880
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Pwedeng mapahaba ang shelf life ng pagkain.

asr-000091
00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:31.000
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Pwedeng mabawasan ang nasasayang na produkto.

asr-000092
00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:36.180
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Pwedeng mapababa ang gasto sa produksyon, sa enerhiya, sa transportasyon at distribusyon.

asr-000093
00:06:36.820 --> 00:06:40.240
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Matutulungan din ang malilihit na negosyo na gumamit ang teknolohiya

asr-000094
00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:43.300
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: upang makalikha ng dekalidad,

asr-000095
00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:47.260
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: ngunit mas murang pagkain, gamot at iba pang pangunahing bilihit.

asr-000096
00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:51.300
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ang DOST po, ramdam na ramdam rin sa pagprotekta ng ating komunidad

asr-000097
00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:58.300
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: laban sa baha, bagyo, matinding init, lindol, paguho ng lupa at iba pang mga sakuna.

asr-000098
00:06:58.300 --> 00:07:03.300
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Sa pamamagitan ng accurate na weather forecasting, hazard mapping, early warning systems,

asr-000099
00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:07.300
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: flood monitoring and climate resilient technologies,

asr-000100
00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:12.300
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: mas maagang nakapaghahanda ang mga lokal na pamahalaan at mga mamamayan.

asr-000101
00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:15.840
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mas maraming buhay ang naliligtas at

asr-000102
00:07:15.840 --> 00:07:17.880
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: inaasahan na mas kaunting tahanan,

asr-000103
00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:21.800
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: pananim, negosyo at imprastraktura ang masisira.

asr-000104
00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:23.840
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ito po yung malinaw na layunin ng ating budget,

asr-000105
00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:29.840
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: gawing kapakikipakinabang ang agham sa pang araw-araw na buhay ng Pilipino.

asr-000106
00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:37.840
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ang tagumpay ng DOST hindi lamang nasusukat sa dami ng pag-aaral, patent, inventions or innovation,

asr-000107
00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:40.840
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: dapat naramdaman na nito ng ating mga kababayan.

asr-000108
00:07:40.840 --> 00:07:44.840
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Sa kanilang pang araw-araw na buhay, sa palengke, sa paaralan,

asr-000109
00:07:44.840 --> 00:07:45.840
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: sa kanilang...

asr-000110
00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:49.280
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: kung saan sila nagtatrabaho at kung saan pa man.

asr-000111
00:07:50.100 --> 00:07:54.220
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Alam po natin na sa tamang paggamit ng aghama teknolohiya,

asr-000112
00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:58.740
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: mas magandang buhay ang maaari nating maipigay sa ating mga kababayan.

asr-000113
00:07:59.180 --> 00:08:02.360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kaya ngayon po, sa pagtutok natin sa budget ng DOST,

asr-000114
00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:08.600
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: sisiguraduhin po natin na ang bawat pisong inilaan sa aghama teknolohiya

asr-000115
00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:12.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: ay humahantong sa mga gandang bagay para sa ating mga kababayan.

asr-000116
00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:16.740
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kurang bilihin, mas ligtas at handang mga pamayanan,

asr-000117
00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:21.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: mas matatag na kabuhayan at mas maginhawang buhay para sa sambayan ng Pilipino.

asr-000118
00:08:22.280 --> 00:08:27.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Uglitin ko po, sabi nga po ni Secretary Solidum, dapat ramdam ang aghama.

asr-000119
00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:30.800
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Alright, with that Secretary, you have the floor.

asr-000120
00:08:31.460 --> 00:08:36.040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Will you be presenting everybody's budget? Ikaw na po lahat.

asr-000121
00:08:36.780 --> 00:08:38.360
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-000122
00:08:38.360 --> 00:08:42.740
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Essentially, just to make it faster,

asr-000123
00:08:42.740 --> 00:08:47.920
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: we recorded the presentation just to provide you a glimpse of all our programs.

asr-000124
00:08:48.140 --> 00:08:49.520
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: So if I may, Mr. Senator,

asr-000125
00:08:50.320 --> 00:08:54.960
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: we are presenting many of the things we have done and our plans

asr-000126
00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:57.600
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: to justify the proposed budget,

asr-000127
00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:04.680
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: which is, as DBM recommended, would be around 30.87 billion pesos.

asr-000128
00:09:06.260 --> 00:09:09.040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Do you have the smallest budget among all the agencies?

asr-000129
00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:10.300
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Hindi naman ata.

asr-000130
00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:10.640
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: DBM?

asr-000131
00:09:10.840 --> 00:09:11.720
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Hindi naman ata.

asr-000132
00:09:11.720 --> 00:09:12.260
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: DTI?

asr-000133
00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:16.200
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Hindi naman ata ba? Anong rank po ng DOST?

asr-000134
00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:19.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Who is our DBM representative?

asr-000135
00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:22.940
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Who is the DBM representative?

asr-000136
00:09:23.060 --> 00:09:24.000
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Director La Bastilla.

asr-000137
00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:26.000
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Director La Bastilla.

asr-000138
00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:29.020
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Sige po, Director.

asr-000139
00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:32.620
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: Ganda ang hapon po, Your Honor.

asr-000140
00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:40.500
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: We will be checking po yung sa DTI and other agencies kasi we're handling po yung sa DOST.

asr-000141
00:09:40.820 --> 00:09:42.720
DBM Budget and Management Bureau-F Director Vivien V. Labastilla: Definitely though, it is one of the lowest.

asr-000142
00:09:42.860 --> 00:09:42.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Right?

asr-000143
00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:46.900
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And that's something we want to move up in the future.

asr-000144
00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:53.720
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, Secretary, when we worked on the education budget last year,

asr-000145
00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:57.660
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: we were able to achieve the target of at least 4% of GDP.

asr-000146
00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:03.740
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I'm sure science and technology research also has a prescribed 1%.

asr-000147
00:10:04.400 --> 00:10:06.220
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ang layo natin sa 1%.

asr-000148
00:10:06.220 --> 00:10:07.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: We're at 0.3.

asr-000149
00:10:08.060 --> 00:10:10.480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So maybe progressively over the years,

asr-000150
00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:12.720
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: we can try to find ways to augment.

asr-000151
00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:15.080
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So pagkatapos po ng presentation ninyo,

asr-000152
00:10:15.620 --> 00:10:18.220
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I'll be having some questions,

asr-000153
00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:19.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: kung meron man.

asr-000154
00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:21.820
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And then later, you can also talk about

asr-000155
00:10:21.820 --> 00:10:24.820
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: if there were priorities that we could,

asr-000156
00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:26.060
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: for augmentation,

asr-000157
00:10:26.760 --> 00:10:28.200
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: could also mention that, Secretary.

asr-000158
00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:31.640
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kung may top two or three items for augmentation,

asr-000159
00:10:32.580 --> 00:10:34.240
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: feel free to talk about it.

asr-000160
00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:36.180
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Hindi ko po pinapangako na matutupad yan,

