asr-000886
00:37:34.820 --> 00:37:39.320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Doon sa ano, of course, one of the hottest issues now is the Pax Silica Initiative.

asr-000887
00:37:40.080 --> 00:37:42.380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: As the primary government agency in the Philippines,

asr-000888
00:37:42.640 --> 00:37:50.040
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: tasked with providing central direction, leadership, and coordination of all scientific and technological efforts in the country.

asr-000889
00:37:50.040 --> 00:37:53.900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: What is the official position of DOST?

asr-000890
00:37:55.680 --> 00:38:00.040
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: The principle of DOST for any development is that it must be sustainable.

asr-000891
00:38:00.720 --> 00:38:08.720
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: So we have to make sure that the development plans are aligned to what we want to create more jobs and opportunities.

asr-000892
00:38:09.320 --> 00:38:18.980
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: While our safeguards should be focused on the environmental and other socioeconomic concerns that we have.

asr-000893
00:38:19.460 --> 00:38:20.020
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Basically,

asr-000894
00:38:20.040 --> 00:38:26.640
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: based on what I have heard from the direct explanation of the program,

asr-000895
00:38:27.440 --> 00:38:29.840
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: the Pax Silica is a global program.

asr-000896
00:38:30.560 --> 00:38:37.800
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: But essentially, the component in the Philippines is a very small part of it.

asr-000897
00:38:38.340 --> 00:38:46.240
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Where the real intent of the component in Clark is to have an advanced manufacturing hub

asr-000898
00:38:46.960 --> 00:38:49.440
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: for accessories that will be related.

asr-000899
00:38:50.040 --> 00:38:50.920
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: In the future,

asr-000900
00:38:51.660 --> 00:38:58.360
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: to chips for other accessories that will be used for data centers or AI hubs.

asr-000901
00:38:58.540 --> 00:39:02.840
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: But those will not be in the Clark area.

asr-000902
00:39:02.840 --> 00:39:08.320
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Second, on the minerals processing, it is not certain yet as this will be negotiated.

asr-000903
00:39:09.080 --> 00:39:15.080
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: As to what minerals, the state of minerals, the critical minerals that they will use.

asr-000904
00:39:15.380 --> 00:39:20.020
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Because for sure, one should not mine and transport it.

asr-000905
00:39:20.040 --> 00:39:25.040
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: But one should not mine and transport it to the area and process it economically.

asr-000906
00:39:25.040 --> 00:39:27.160
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: And therefore, those still have to be discussed.

asr-000907
00:39:27.420 --> 00:39:35.020
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: So we have to make sure that the development in the area will really promote the economy of the country

asr-000908
00:39:35.020 --> 00:39:41.020
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: while making sure that the environmental concerns and the social concerns within the area will be addressed.

asr-000909
00:39:41.140 --> 00:39:41.500
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Thank you.

asr-000910
