asr-000913
00:39:50.040 --> 00:39:55.760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Also, if you are based on the initial assessment with the creation of this venture,

asr-000914
00:39:55.880 --> 00:39:59.080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: the Pax Silica, outweigh the severe environmental risk,

asr-000915
00:39:59.220 --> 00:40:00.660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: mayroon ba ako yung study na rin?

asr-000916
00:40:00.780 --> 00:40:05.380
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Well, essentially, if they will be operating an industrial hub,

asr-000917
00:40:05.680 --> 00:40:09.460
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: we have many industrial hubs in the Philippines like in Cavite, Depeza.

asr-000918
00:40:09.980 --> 00:40:13.280
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: So we are very, very strict on our environmental laws.

asr-000919
00:40:13.400 --> 00:40:16.660
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: And this must be, of course, be led by the DNR.

asr-000920
00:40:17.720 --> 00:40:19.140
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: So marami na po tayong experience.

asr-000921
00:40:19.140 --> 00:40:22.580
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: And pagdating sa environmental law, dapat very strict.

asr-000922
00:40:22.980 --> 00:40:26.220
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: At wala namang naging issue out of the PESA zones that we have.

asr-000923
00:40:28.740 --> 00:40:30.120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay, thank you.

asr-000924
00:40:30.680 --> 00:40:31.420
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Doon lang po sa ano.

asr-000925
00:40:32.280 --> 00:40:36.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: August this year, DBM released 1 billion for continued implementation expansion

asr-000926
00:40:36.540 --> 00:40:40.800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: of the nationwide operation assessment of hazards or Project NOAA.

asr-000927
00:40:41.380 --> 00:40:45.440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: According to the UP Resilience Institute, it's a good start, but I think it's not,

asr-000928
00:40:45.680 --> 00:40:46.800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: we feel it's not enough.

asr-000929
