Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: May we know if Project NOAA has,

asr-000930
00:40:49.140 --> 00:40:52.820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: budget allocation under your department or any of your attached agency

asr-000931
00:40:52.820 --> 00:40:56.380
