asr-000932
00:40:57.720 --> 00:41:00.840
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: NOAA is operated by the University of the Philippines.

asr-000933
00:41:01.580 --> 00:41:05.840
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: And we have other disaster and climate-related programs

asr-000934
00:41:05.840 --> 00:41:11.260
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: that would complement the provision of information and knowledge

asr-000935
00:41:11.260 --> 00:41:15.440
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: to various stakeholders, including government agencies, industries,

asr-000936
00:41:16.020 --> 00:41:17.500
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: and more importantly, communities.

asr-000937
00:41:18.060 --> 00:41:19.020
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: So we have developed...

asr-000938
00:41:19.140 --> 00:41:22.260
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: We have developed many programs and web applications

asr-000939
00:41:22.260 --> 00:41:29.540
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: and even phone applications that would enable people to have access to data

asr-000940
00:41:29.540 --> 00:41:32.800
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: from the different mandated organizations po.

asr-000941
00:41:33.300 --> 00:41:34.860
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: And just to separate,

asr-000942
00:41:36.000 --> 00:41:40.860
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: PHIVOX would essentially be the one just providing all the geologic information.

asr-000943
00:41:41.220 --> 00:41:42.300
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Wala pong counterpart dyan.

asr-000944
00:41:42.700 --> 00:41:43.940
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Sila po talaga yung mandated.

asr-000945
00:41:44.220 --> 00:41:45.700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay, thank you, Secretary.

