asr-000957
00:42:30.620 --> 00:42:34.040
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Of course, different agencies would have specific needs.

asr-000958
00:42:34.580 --> 00:42:37.540
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: And if the agency is cited like PHIVOX and PNRI,

asr-000959
00:42:37.940 --> 00:42:43.380
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: these are usually capital outlays that sometimes would have procurement delays

asr-000960
00:42:43.380 --> 00:42:45.940
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: because some of the equipment are not off the shelf.

asr-000961
00:42:45.940 --> 00:42:48.940
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: So you have to wait a little bit sometimes around two years.

asr-000962
00:42:49.140 --> 00:42:51.420
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: So pagdating po naman sa ibang ahensya,

asr-000963
00:42:51.720 --> 00:42:55.440
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: we really need the budget because based on our experience,

asr-000964
00:42:55.540 --> 00:42:59.040
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: we can create more impact that would translate to more livelihood,

asr-000965
00:42:59.700 --> 00:43:00.780
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: more efficient processes.

asr-000966
00:43:01.480 --> 00:43:05.500
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: And so yung pong minsan utilization issue is more on the capital outlay.

asr-000967
00:43:07.100 --> 00:43:12.400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: In 2025, the DOSD accumulated 2.85 billion in unused appropriations

asr-000968
