asr-000974
00:43:31.300 --> 00:43:34.900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: O ba't ganito kalaki na umabot yung unused appropriations natin?

asr-000975
00:43:35.020 --> 00:43:37.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At bakano ang nabalik sa National Treasury?

asr-000976
00:43:37.740 --> 00:43:43.620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pasensya na, we have to ask now because of our very, very limited fiscal space,

asr-000977
00:43:43.620 --> 00:43:48.820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: we have to make sure that all our appropriations are well spent.

asr-000978
