asr-000988
00:44:34.400 --> 00:44:40.300
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: And we're confident before the year ends, this will be utilized or obligated.

asr-000989
00:44:40.720 --> 00:44:42.200
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: Thank you, Chair.

asr-000990
00:44:44.480 --> 00:44:48.280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, on target, end of the year, it will be fully utilized.

asr-000991
00:44:48.440 --> 00:44:49.060
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung mga equipment.

asr-000992
00:44:49.140 --> 00:44:50.940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Natin, it's already operational.

asr-000993
00:44:51.460 --> 00:44:52.160
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: Yes, yes.

asr-000994
00:44:53.540 --> 00:44:53.960
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: Yes, sir.

