asr-001018
00:46:37.940 --> 00:46:43.140
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: Interventions include fast tracking the procurement process.

asr-001019
00:46:43.140 --> 00:46:47.160
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: Of course, the equipment involved is sophisticated

asr-001020
00:46:47.160 --> 00:46:49.920
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: and is manufactured overseas.

asr-001021
00:46:50.620 --> 00:46:54.220
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: It takes time before, of course, it is to be installed.

asr-001022
00:46:55.000 --> 00:46:58.300
