asr-001023
00:46:58.540 --> 00:47:00.540
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: we have already done the fast tracking.

asr-001024
00:47:00.540 --> 00:47:03.540
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: And at the moment, in fact, as I've mentioned,

asr-001025
00:47:03.540 --> 00:47:08.540
