asr-001026
00:47:08.540 --> 00:47:13.540
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: And of course, the remaining components will be closely monitored

asr-001027
00:47:13.540 --> 00:47:18.540
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: until, since 2025, this 2025 budget,

asr-001028
00:47:18.540 --> 00:47:21.540
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: and this is continuing until December this year,

asr-001029
00:47:21.540 --> 00:47:24.540
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: we're confident it will be utilized.

asr-001030
00:47:24.540 --> 00:47:25.540
