PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: Good afternoon, Chairs, Your Honorable Chairs.

asr-001034
00:47:32.540 --> 00:47:38.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: For the justification for the low utilization,

asr-001035
00:47:38.540 --> 00:47:41.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: it's because of the nuclear medicine project.

asr-001036
00:47:41.540 --> 00:47:47.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: The reason for this low obligation or low utilization

asr-001037
00:47:47.540 --> 00:47:50.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: is first is the procurement planning needed to be revisited

asr-001038
00:47:50.540 --> 00:47:54.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: to align with the actual project implementation progress

asr-001039
00:47:54.540 --> 00:47:57.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: and to create a more efficient budget utilization.

asr-001040
00:47:57.540 --> 00:47:59.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: It's because of some procurement packages

asr-001041
00:47:59.540 --> 00:48:03.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: were therefore not yet sufficiently matured or procurement ready.

asr-001042
00:48:03.540 --> 00:48:07.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: The second one is the project undertook a more thorough review

asr-001043
00:48:07.540 --> 00:48:10.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: of its technical and procurement documents.

asr-001044
00:48:10.540 --> 00:48:13.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: And the last one, the third one,

asr-001045
00:48:13.540 --> 00:48:16.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: is the regulatory legal requirements as being addressed.

asr-001046
00:48:16.540 --> 00:48:20.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: So our catch-up measures is the completion of the procurement documents,

asr-001047
00:48:20.540 --> 00:48:23.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: the engineering plans, terms of references,

asr-001048
00:48:23.540 --> 00:48:26.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: and the technical specifications and other details,

asr-001049
00:48:26.540 --> 00:48:33.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: cost estimate will be expedited with the current target of completion

asr-001050
00:48:33.540 --> 00:48:36.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: and submissions of major building requirements.

asr-001051
00:48:36.540 --> 00:48:40.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: Secondly is the resolutions of the legal and implementation concerns

asr-001052
00:48:40.540 --> 00:48:44.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: of which the PNRI is coordinating with appropriate legal authorities

asr-001053
00:48:44.540 --> 00:48:47.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: and strengthening internal legal support

asr-001054
00:48:47.540 --> 00:48:49.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: to facilitate timely resolutions of issues

asr-001055
00:48:49.540 --> 00:48:52.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: that have been affected the project itself.

asr-001056
00:48:52.540 --> 00:48:56.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: The implementation of the revised project roadmap

asr-001057
00:48:56.540 --> 00:49:00.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: The revised roadmap is being used to utilize a clear sequence

asr-001058
00:49:00.540 --> 00:49:04.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: for technical procurement and legal and implementation activities

asr-001059
00:49:04.540 --> 00:49:07.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: to be bring to the major procurement packages

asr-001060
00:49:07.540 --> 00:49:10.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: to the required level of readiness.

asr-001061
00:49:10.540 --> 00:49:16.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: So right now po, we are now working expediting this process

asr-001062
00:49:16.540 --> 00:49:20.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: to make sure that the utilization for the nuclear medicine project

asr-001063
00:49:20.540 --> 00:49:22.540
PNRI Deputy Director Maria Teresa A. Salabit: will be expedited.

asr-001064
00:49:22.540 --> 00:49:23.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you.

asr-001065
00:49:23.540 --> 00:49:25.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mr. Chair,

asr-001066
00:49:25.540 --> 00:49:31.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: at the time when the Philippines faces escalating climate catastrophes,

asr-001067
00:49:31.540 --> 00:49:34.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: proposed fiscal year 2027 budget slashes

asr-001068
00:49:34.540 --> 00:49:38.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pag-ASA's weather and climate forecasting and warning

asr-001069
00:49:38.540 --> 00:49:45.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: programmed by 53.4% from 1.08 billion to 707.9 million.

asr-001070
00:49:45.540 --> 00:49:48.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So the funding early warning projects and AI forecasting,

asr-001071
00:49:48.540 --> 00:49:52.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: what is the position of DOST and PAGASA on this?

asr-001072
00:49:52.540 --> 00:49:54.540
