asr-001073
00:49:54.540 --> 00:49:57.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: What would be the effect of this budget cut

asr-001074
00:49:57.540 --> 00:49:59.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: in the operation of Pag-ASA?

