asr-001077
00:50:03.540 --> 00:50:09.540
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: essentially, many of the decrease in the current proposed 27 budget

asr-001078
00:50:09.540 --> 00:50:16.540
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: is related to the actual completion of many of the capital outlay projects.

asr-001079
00:50:16.540 --> 00:50:17.540
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: So that is the reason.

asr-001080
00:50:17.540 --> 00:50:22.540
