00:50:32.540 --> 00:50:36.540
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: about 12.3%.

asr-001085
00:50:36.540 --> 00:50:41.540
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: And yeah, particularly in the capital outlay

asr-001086
00:50:41.540 --> 00:50:45.540
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: because there are projects that are already implemented

asr-001087
00:50:45.540 --> 00:50:53.540
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: and it does not require additional continuing funding for next year.

asr-001088
00:50:53.540 --> 00:51:02.540
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: And of course, one of the reasons why there is a decrease in our budget,

asr-001089
00:51:02.540 --> 00:51:05.540
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: particularly on the OOE component,

asr-001090
00:51:05.540 --> 00:51:10.540
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: is because there's a decrease in the so-called CECA

asr-001091
00:51:10.540 --> 00:51:12.540
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: or the Congressional Initiative last year,

asr-001092
00:51:12.540 --> 00:51:16.540
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: which is now reduced for next year.

asr-001093
00:51:16.540 --> 00:51:21.540
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: And yeah, particularly on,

asr-001094
00:51:21.540 --> 00:51:27.540
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: which includes one of the locally funded projects,

asr-001095
00:51:27.540 --> 00:51:31.540
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: the EI for RP.

asr-001096
00:51:31.540 --> 00:51:36.540
PAGASA Administrator Nathaniel T. Servando: But anyway, this is continuing for next year.

asr-001097
00:51:36.540 --> 00:51:40.540
