asr-002157
01:18:38.480 --> 01:18:44.760
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Yung gana ng mga cotton farmer, gusto nang magproduce nang magproduce kasi meron ng bumibili.

asr-002158
01:18:45.500 --> 01:18:48.820
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: So the Batangas Egg Producers Cooperative is another one.

asr-002159
01:18:48.820 --> 01:18:49.820
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Their problem was...

asr-002160
01:18:49.820 --> 01:18:56.120
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Yung mga maninipis ang shell, madaling mabasag, tinatapon na lang yan.

asr-002161
01:18:56.540 --> 01:19:00.020
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: But because of technology, they can now preserve it.

asr-002162
01:19:00.300 --> 01:19:06.960
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: And with the ITDI technology, yung spray drying technique, you can actually create powders out of it.

asr-002163
01:19:07.460 --> 01:19:09.560
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: And the shelf life will be at least two years.

asr-002164
01:19:10.180 --> 01:19:10.860
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: So, yun po.

asr-002165
01:19:11.500 --> 01:19:13.720
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Tomorrow, I'll visit another place.

asr-002166
01:19:13.880 --> 01:19:15.640
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: It's called NutriDense Corporation.

asr-002167
01:19:16.300 --> 01:19:18.640
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: He started his business by utilizing...

asr-002168
01:19:19.820 --> 01:19:22.740
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: FNRI's nutritious product.

asr-002169
01:19:23.800 --> 01:19:26.220
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: And the engagement is continuous.

asr-002170
01:19:26.720 --> 01:19:34.640
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: The real strategy now, Your Honor, is to make sure that we actually evaluate the innovation ecosystem.

asr-002171
01:19:34.880 --> 01:19:38.960
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: There are producers, there are small enterprises, micro-enterprises.

asr-002172
01:19:39.700 --> 01:19:42.540
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Then we have the consumer, but no one would...

asr-002173
01:19:43.100 --> 01:19:43.860
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: In the middle.

asr-002174
01:19:43.860 --> 01:19:49.200
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: So we wanted to make sure that we have some firms in the middle.

asr-002175
01:19:49.820 --> 01:19:58.780
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Before I came in, the setup would only provide assistance to the enterprise two times only.

asr-002176
01:19:59.800 --> 01:20:01.100
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: So, binago po natin yun.

asr-002177
01:20:01.200 --> 01:20:05.720
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: So, kung lumalaki siya, at dumadami yung supplier niya at yung mga sales niya,

asr-002178
01:20:06.140 --> 01:20:11.500
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: pa tayo tumitigil sa pagtulong palakihin natin pa magkaroon ng mas maraming sales, mas maraming trabaho.

asr-002179
01:20:12.300 --> 01:20:13.620
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: So, this is what we're doing.

asr-002180
01:20:13.620 --> 01:20:19.300
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: In the electric vehicle industry, President and I visited a manufacturing plant.

asr-002181
01:20:19.300 --> 01:20:22.420
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Who is willing to develop the e-trikes that we prototype.

asr-002182
01:20:23.640 --> 01:20:24.340
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: And willing siya.

asr-002183
01:20:24.620 --> 01:20:28.800
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Ang kailangan lang niya is continuous partnership with the DOST experts.

asr-002184
01:20:29.420 --> 01:20:32.420
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: And then very willing yung mga toda gusto nang bumili, inaanap na.

asr-002185
01:20:32.820 --> 01:20:35.300
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: So, tama po yung inyong sinasabi.

asr-002186
01:20:35.420 --> 01:20:43.880
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: And we have a program to really advertise to potential investors and industrial partners the different technologies.

asr-002187
01:20:43.880 --> 01:20:48.820
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Ang kailangan lang po siguro, mabago din yung university.

asr-002188
01:20:49.300 --> 01:20:52.720
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Ang framework na hanggang publication lang sila eh.

asr-002189
01:20:53.160 --> 01:20:55.200
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: So, nire-record natin sila na hanggang market.

asr-002190
01:20:55.800 --> 01:21:01.440
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: And also to make sure na pagdating sa mga university, hindi lang paper ang publication,

asr-002191
01:21:01.720 --> 01:21:05.020
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: ang indicator for promotion, pati yung commercialization.

asr-002192
01:21:06.080 --> 01:21:13.320
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Kulang pa rin ng investment ang mga Filipino businessmen, like countries that you mentioned.

asr-002193
01:21:13.320 --> 01:21:14.880
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Pero tinutuloy po natin.

asr-002194
01:21:15.140 --> 01:21:18.340
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: So, we will be having continuous dialogue with them.

asr-002195
01:21:18.340 --> 01:21:23.880
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Kaya yung looking for manufacturing partners that can scale production, yun po ang isang ginagawa.

asr-002196
01:21:24.020 --> 01:21:26.940
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: And I think gumagana na po yun.

asr-002197
01:21:27.040 --> 01:21:28.200
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: It would just take time.

asr-002198
01:21:28.320 --> 01:21:31.360
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Hindi ka agad makukuha yung ganong mindset.

asr-002199
01:21:31.760 --> 01:21:35.940
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I would suggest, Secretary, because I'm also handling that ETI budget.

asr-002200
01:21:36.780 --> 01:21:41.560
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ang request kasi ni Secretary Roque is to fund more fairs, trade fairs.

asr-002201
01:21:41.560 --> 01:21:47.760
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Baka pwedeng may isang major trade fair na lahat ng produkto ng,

asr-002202
01:21:47.760 --> 01:21:52.000
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: tinulungan ng DOST, who are already at that point that they're willing to go to market.

asr-002203
01:21:52.160 --> 01:21:57.160
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kasi, make no mistake, there are some who really want to do research, they don't want to go into business.

asr-002204
01:21:57.460 --> 01:21:58.760
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, we should respect that.

asr-002205
01:21:59.220 --> 01:22:02.620
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kasi, ano po talaga, hindi mo yan mapipilit na mag-commercialize.

asr-002206
01:22:03.120 --> 01:22:04.560
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And they want to do the research.

asr-002207
01:22:05.040 --> 01:22:05.960
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, iba yung path nila.

asr-002208
01:22:06.320 --> 01:22:09.320
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But there are some, I think, who really want to go to market.

asr-002209
01:22:09.320 --> 01:22:11.840
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: At dalawa naman yan.

asr-002210
01:22:12.000 --> 01:22:17.220
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Either they want to grow the business themselves, and I know there are programs that you have already for that, like set up.

asr-002211
01:22:17.760 --> 01:22:25.840
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And there are those who would rather partner with another group and get royalties na lang.

asr-002212
01:22:27.420 --> 01:22:43.820
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Nalilink up nung ahensya na mga businesses to the startups and to the scientists are functioning businesses already with a track record in marketing products.

asr-002213
01:22:43.820 --> 01:22:47.360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, this is something we can also start to develop.

asr-002214
01:22:47.760 --> 01:22:49.160
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yes, Mr. Senator.

asr-002215
01:22:50.160 --> 01:22:52.200
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ako, I would suggest maganda ito with DTI.

asr-002216
01:22:52.440 --> 01:22:56.560
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kasi, they do a lot of thematic trade fairs.

asr-002217
01:22:56.960 --> 01:23:03.540
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Baka we can talk to Secretary Roque na may isa tayong trade fair din na the best of the best of the OST.

asr-002218
01:23:03.940 --> 01:23:13.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And marami sa trade fairs po ng DTI, they really attract an international audience because yung trade attachés of DTI also are marketing this abroad.

asr-002219
01:23:13.920 --> 01:23:17.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, baka maganda mong mag-link up tayo dyan.

asr-002220
01:23:17.760 --> 01:23:21.880
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Innovative Startup Act actually is both a baby of the OST and DTI.

asr-002221
01:23:22.000 --> 01:23:22.820
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: That's also my law.

asr-002222
01:23:23.440 --> 01:23:30.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, baka magandang either through that framework or through another framework, we can look at how we can support this further.

asr-002223
01:23:31.740 --> 01:23:42.160
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And our goal is in the next five years, for example, we have homegrown technologies and inventions here that eventually will be seen everywhere.

asr-002224
01:23:42.160 --> 01:23:47.160
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kasi, nangihinayag rin po ako ang maraming produkto at invention na...

asr-002225
01:23:47.760 --> 01:23:53.000
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Hindi na nagpo-progress into a full market reach.

asr-002226
01:23:53.460 --> 01:24:02.580
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Like, usually, nag-end up lang siya sa mga pasalubong center or nag-end up lang siya in a very localized marketing area.

asr-002227
01:24:03.020 --> 01:24:07.620
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: While many of those technologies with the right support can actually really scale up.

asr-002228
01:24:07.620 --> 01:24:09.580
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But again, the model is different.

asr-002229
01:24:09.780 --> 01:24:16.260
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Sometimes kasi marami sa mga DOST supported really want to continue researching.

asr-002230
01:24:16.640 --> 01:24:17.620
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, I'm sure...

asr-002231
01:24:17.760 --> 01:24:19.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I'm sure we can find a way to do that, sir.

asr-002232
01:24:19.640 --> 01:24:21.860
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, we can work on that with DTI also.

asr-002233
01:24:22.880 --> 01:24:23.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Okay.

asr-002234
01:24:24.220 --> 01:24:26.160
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Let me ask about AI.

asr-002235
01:24:28.200 --> 01:24:34.480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Is DOST or is it DICT, which is the main agency watching out for AI?

asr-002236
01:24:34.480 --> 01:24:42.060
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And possible good things and bad things that will come from the AI revolution currently happening?

asr-002237
01:24:42.800 --> 01:24:47.740
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: DOST was asked to lead the development of the National AI Strategy.

asr-002238
01:24:47.760 --> 01:24:54.100
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: So, we developed the AI Strategy Framework and Implementation Strategy.

asr-002239
01:24:54.640 --> 01:24:57.240
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: This was approved last May or last year.

asr-002240
01:24:57.440 --> 01:24:58.360
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Okay. So, one year na.

asr-002241
01:24:58.520 --> 01:25:02.860
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: And ginawa po natin doon, hinati po natin kung sino may gawa.

asr-002242
01:25:03.220 --> 01:25:09.620
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: So, pagdating po sa infrastructure and connectivity, DICT po talaga yun.

asr-002243
01:25:09.740 --> 01:25:15.120
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Kaya marinig niyo po sila na nag-launch sila ng Infrastructure and Connectivity Master Plan.

asr-002244
01:25:15.600 --> 01:25:17.740
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Pagdating naman sa governance and policy,

asr-002245
01:25:17.760 --> 01:25:23.960
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: kami will be talent creation like Masters and PhD, R&amp;D and commercialization,

asr-002246
01:25:24.100 --> 01:25:26.360
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: of course, together with the private sector and DTI.

asr-002247
01:25:27.140 --> 01:25:35.360
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: On skills, on workforce development, of course, we have TESDA for the employees right now with the private sector,

asr-002248
01:25:35.920 --> 01:25:38.580
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: and then DepEd and CHED, and of course, we will assist.

asr-002249
01:25:39.140 --> 01:25:45.160
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Now, on the DOST side, I think pagdating po sa talagang operational, kami po yung advanced.

asr-002250
01:25:45.160 --> 01:25:47.160
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: As we have established the...

asr-002251
01:25:47.760 --> 01:25:53.360
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: computing facility already, which we are actually increasing the compute.

asr-002252
01:25:53.780 --> 01:25:57.220
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: So, we established the National AI Center for Research and Innovation.

asr-002253
01:25:57.960 --> 01:26:02.060
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: And one of the target is to provide AI as a service to MSME.

asr-002254
01:26:02.620 --> 01:26:06.480
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: So, yung strategy po yan, hindi lang Advanced Science and Technology Institute.

asr-002255
01:26:06.900 --> 01:26:10.700
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Lahat po ng director, regional office, ginagawa po natin niya.

asr-002256
01:26:10.860 --> 01:26:14.600
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: May kanya-kanya pong development together with the RTC using AI.

asr-002257
01:26:14.600 --> 01:26:17.740
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: So, we have concept.

asr-002258
01:26:17.760 --> 01:26:19.700
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: We have conceptualized a human-centered AI.

asr-002259
01:26:20.440 --> 01:26:25.960
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: So, essentially, AI helping us perform better and of quality.

asr-002260
01:26:26.060 --> 01:26:27.860
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, that's under ASTI?

asr-002261
01:26:28.300 --> 01:26:29.600
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ang National AI Center?

asr-002262
01:26:29.660 --> 01:26:30.900
DOST Secretary Renato U. Solidum Jr.: Yes po, sa ASTI po.

asr-002263
01:26:31.040 --> 01:26:31.560
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Okay, sige.

asr-002264
01:26:31.680 --> 01:26:32.940
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kay Dr. De Leon, no?

asr-002265
01:26:33.560 --> 01:26:34.900
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, ito naman po, mungkahi lang.

asr-002266
01:26:36.900 --> 01:26:47.740
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Are we starting to train an LLM or an AI on Filipino culture, values,

asr-002267
01:26:47.800 --> 01:26:48.800
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: history?

asr-002268
01:26:49.360 --> 01:26:50.360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Are we starting to do that?

asr-002269
01:26:51.440 --> 01:26:52.440
DOST-ASTI Director Franz A. de Leon: Good afternoon, Your Honor.

asr-002270
01:26:52.440 --> 01:26:53.440
DOST-ASTI Director Franz A. de Leon: Thank you, Secretary.

asr-002271
01:26:53.440 --> 01:26:54.440
DOST-ASTI Director Franz A. de Leon: Yes po.

asr-002272
01:26:54.440 --> 01:27:01.440
DOST-ASTI Director Franz A. de Leon: Fortunately, actually, Secretary Bispo has a very strong support on establishing our own LLM.

asr-002273
01:27:01.440 --> 01:27:05.440
DOST-ASTI Director Franz A. de Leon: Basic na rin po sa his personal experience because he goes throughout the country.

asr-002274
01:27:05.440 --> 01:27:10.440
DOST-ASTI Director Franz A. de Leon: So, most often than not, he would need such application.

asr-002275
01:27:10.440 --> 01:27:14.440
DOST-ASTI Director Franz A. de Leon: So hindi lang verbally, DOST is really supporting that program.

asr-002276
01:27:14.440 --> 01:27:17.440
DOST-ASTI Director Franz A. de Leon: In fact, kaka-approval po ng major program.

asr-002277
01:27:17.440 --> 01:27:20.440
DOST-ASTI Director Franz A. de Leon: On developing our own LLM.

asr-002278
01:27:20.440 --> 01:27:29.440
DOST-ASTI Director Franz A. de Leon: Covering not just the major languages but also traversing even yung mga mas kaunti pa na nagsasalita na languages.

asr-002279
01:27:29.440 --> 01:27:33.440
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yes, and more importantly, cultural and history, no?

asr-002280
01:27:33.440 --> 01:27:36.440
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, the National AI Center is in charge of that.

asr-002281
01:27:36.440 --> 01:27:38.440
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Are you gonna make that open to the public?

asr-002282
01:27:38.440 --> 01:27:40.440
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Is it already open to the public?

asr-002283
01:27:40.440 --> 01:27:44.440
DOST-ASTI Director Franz A. de Leon: We will make it available to the public hopefully by next year.

asr-002284
01:27:44.440 --> 01:27:45.440
DOST-ASTI Director Franz A. de Leon: So, i-distinguish ko lang po.

asr-002285
01:27:45.440 --> 01:27:46.920
DOST-ASTI Director Franz A. de Leon: Yung NAICRI, National AI Center.

asr-002286
01:27:46.920 --> 01:27:48.920
DOST-ASTI Director Franz A. de Leon: National AI Center for Research Innovation.

asr-002287
01:27:48.920 --> 01:27:51.920
DOST-ASTI Director Franz A. de Leon: So, that's the infrastructure part.

asr-002288
01:27:51.920 --> 01:27:54.920
DOST-ASTI Director Franz A. de Leon: The whole AI program being supported by DOST.

asr-002289
01:27:54.920 --> 01:27:57.920
DOST-ASTI Director Franz A. de Leon: Yung pong sa LLM program, it's a completely new program.

asr-002290
01:27:57.920 --> 01:28:04.920
DOST-ASTI Director Franz A. de Leon: But of course, in terms of utilizing the infrastructure being used, doon po sila nagtatagpo.

asr-002291
01:28:04.920 --> 01:28:06.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Is that in your budget?

asr-002292
01:28:06.920 --> 01:28:08.920
DOST-ASTI Director Franz A. de Leon: It will be. So, currently...

asr-002293
01:28:08.920 --> 01:28:11.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, it's not in the 2027 budget?

asr-002294
01:28:11.920 --> 01:28:14.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, it's OSEC? Nasa OSEC pa?

asr-002295
01:28:14.920 --> 01:28:15.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Okay.

asr-002296
01:28:15.920 --> 01:28:24.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, the importance of this is because the AI that we use is currently mostly the American AI, no?

asr-002297
01:28:24.920 --> 01:28:26.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: American-made AI.

asr-002298
01:28:26.920 --> 01:28:31.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I don't think marami pang nagdi-deep-seek sa Pilipinas but definitely Claude, Gemini, etc.

asr-002299
01:28:31.920 --> 01:28:33.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mas maraming gumagamit.

asr-002300
01:28:33.920 --> 01:28:41.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And this was something I got familiarized to when I had my fellowship in the US.

asr-002301
01:28:41.920 --> 01:28:43.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Na...

asr-002302
01:28:43.920 --> 01:28:48.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: As you keep on using the AI, the AI...

asr-002303
01:28:48.920 --> 01:28:51.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: You're training the AI but the AI is also training you.

asr-002304
01:28:51.920 --> 01:28:58.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And a lot of the time, the output that it gives you is from the perspective of the creators of the AI.

asr-002305
01:28:58.920 --> 01:29:04.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, if it's American, it's some 32-year-old in Silicon Valley.

asr-002306
01:29:04.920 --> 01:29:09.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And whatever they input there, yun din yung nare-regurgitate back to you, diba?

asr-002307
01:29:09.920 --> 01:29:11.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, if we're not careful...

asr-002308
01:29:11.920 --> 01:29:16.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Our countrymen, our youth are all using AI coming from other countries.

asr-002309
01:29:16.920 --> 01:29:23.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Eventually, there will be a type of assimilation of culture, language, and mores, and norms, no?

asr-002310
01:29:23.920 --> 01:29:26.920
